  "description": "Vintage Mark IIC+ Lead mode with the early tone stack, cascaded lead stages, and parallel dry path. Bright, Deep and graphic EQ bypassed, effects loop normalled and reverb dry. Uses the 100 W non-Simul-Class four-6L6GC output section, including the vintage feedback and Presence network. The 8 Ω load and output transformer use estimated winding parameters.",
